# Local runtime state written by the `postman dataset` engine (SQLite
# caches, daemon logs, per-dataset connection dirs). Not git-native data —
# only the .dataset.yaml files and the source files they reference
# (e.g. .resources/*.csv) belong in version control.
**/.resources/data.db
**/.resources/meta.db
**/.resources/daemon.log
**/.resources/config/
**/.resources/*-*-*-*-*/
